    <title>EP 08 为什么Netflix这么牛？大道至简的商业模式和管理哲学！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9073a33ddcbb53c323fdb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9073a33ddcbb53c323fdb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 15:31:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYaR2-cR4faDLxgtCKn2M5XnHlZ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>今天这期内容纯享Netflix从DVD时代—转型流媒体阶段—内容为王时代的发展史，并且从中来分析哈斯廷斯及其团队大道至简的商业模式创新与独树一帜的管理哲学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】陈宸Ashley</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间线】</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期播客总时长 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 关注Netflix的源起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">1:54</a> Netflix让我震惊的股价涨势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">4:51</a> Netflix的创始人之一Reed Hastings的背景介绍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7Vukj8qtFP3wFmgMqahILPbJE1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">6:54</a> Netflix比较久远的卖碟片时期：对商业模式的创新</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftm0TES-hEIrFpnaqXzl08avU_Dm.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> Netflix进入转战流媒体的阶段：对推荐算法的创新</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCdVVwIvI363QErxOK_wg2ITLVB.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> Netflix的内容为王时代：《纸牌屋》的大爆、对自制内容的持续极致追求</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtL4k8LMxCL3Ol7VU5e97FMsye3m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> Netflix跟国内流媒体平台的模式对比：娱乐模式v.s互联网模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> Netflix的管理哲学：“自由+责任”、“高薪酬激励+有效的淘汰机制”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> Netflix的薪酬激励特色：全员自主选择权、补充福利、退休金置换期权等</span></p><span></span><p><span>【插图来源】</span></p><span></span><p><span>互联网</span></p><span></span><p><span>【配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Netflix片头音效</span></p><span></span><p><span>SWM-Sunset Hill</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【写在最后】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>感谢你的收听，欢迎订阅，欢迎推荐，欢迎交流，欢迎一切。</span></p><span></span><p><span>点亮职业灯塔，塑造光明未来。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>微信公众号：职场海海</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-MnO06aRLBTPjpZ81gZe5N_IkF.png"></figure>]]></description>
